{
  "name": "ondra-rhythm",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的分条与停顿纯函数（手册 §9.2 / §3.3）：≤4 条、每条 ≤40 字、6 字每秒、标点附加 300/500/150ms、停顿 300–6000ms（先卡限→深夜 ×1.6→再卡限）、首字延迟 800–2000ms、长停顿 20% × 3000–9000ms（整轮最多一次）、自我修正 5%（默认不插入）、超限保留前 3 条并把尾部合并成第 4 条。只算不发：计时执行归 ondra-rhythm-typing，删改正文归 ondra-filter-chain。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
